e.\n- **Constraint (candidate algorithm):** Met; Algorithm-L1 confirmed in candidate_specs.md.\n- **Constraint (hardware deployable):** Met; all candidates fit FPGA resources.\n- **Constraint (threshold 20\u201360 GeV):** Met; 40 GeV used.\n- **Constraint (single clear recommendation):** Met; see above.\n\nProceeding to submit this recommendation.", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": null}, {"arguments": "{\"option\":\"Algorithm-L1\",\"threshold_gev\":40,\"justification\":\"Algorithm-L1 at a 40 GeV threshold achieves the highest signal efficiency at the allowed 8 kHz trigger rate, based on direct simulation and corroborated by previous emulation results. It meets all deployment criteria and outperforms the alternatives across the valid threshold range.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"The algorithm must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Algorithm-L1 is listed in candidate_specs.md.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The algorithm must be deployable in the Level-1 trigger hardware.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"All three candidates fit within FPGA resource budget as specified in candidate_specs.md.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Threshold between 20 and 60 GeV.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Chosen threshold is 40 GeV.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the highest possible signal efficiency at the allocated trigger rate.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Algorithm-L1 at 40 GeV achieves over 91% signal efficiency while staying within the allocated 8 kHz according to simulation and previous emulation studies.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended algorithm and threshold.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Single, clear recommendation submitted: Algorithm-L1 at 40 GeV.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_KQ7ttQiXIEtC6gINsTzGgm89", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_06507375bb90ffef006afced56b0108